reativeuncut.com/gallery-37/feth-ingrid-concept.html\n※制服によって角や尻尾などの特徴が隠れてしまう場合は、その部分は省略していただいて問題ありません。\n\n■ご希望の内容\n・画角：全身（角と尻尾まで収まる構図）／縦長\n・ポーズ：正面〜やや斜めに、静かに佇む立ち姿\n・表情：無表情〜ほんのり憂いを帯びた表情、視線はこちらへ\n・雰囲気：クールで透明感のある、静謐な空気感\n・背景：淡い青〜グレーの単色、または簡単な装飾程度\n\n上記をベースに、細かな演出や仕上げは先生の作風で自由にアレンジしていただけますと嬉しいです。\nどうぞご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 132631, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぱなみ", "screen_name": "pana__mi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991119185741815808/gjkNoVGs.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/706522668451794945/1774851381/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 1120911, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "九十九屋", "screen_name": "99ya01", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1509681470734204928/MtbY73wH.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1407872101/1633747916/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 2585731, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "Suu", "screen_name": "Suu3query", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2041153640522829824/v7tvYX-i.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1403930106792271874/1779196205/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": nul